---
// Flight booking two ways: a workflow with four fixed nodes vs. an autonomous agent that picks its next tool at run time.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 420"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d-wva-title d-wva-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d-wva-title">Workflow vs. autonomous agent for flight booking</title>
	<desc id="d-wva-desc">
		Left, the workflow: four fixed nodes run in order, verify identity, search flights, complete payment, confirm
		booking. The path is fixed in code and the LLM works inside each node. Right, the autonomous agent: the agent sits
		at the center and calls search, verify identity when login is required, and ask user when a layover needs
		approval, returning to itself after each call. The path is chosen at run time and stops on a stop condition.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d-wva-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="10" y="10" width="340" height="400" rx="14"></rect>
		<text x="26" y="40" font-weight="700">Workflow: path fixed in code</text>
		<text x="180" y="394" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">LLM works inside each node</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="42" y="64" width="276" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="180" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">1 Verify identity</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="180" y1="120" x2="180" y2="144" marker-end="url(#d-wva-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="42" y="146" width="276" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="180" y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">2 Search flights</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="180" y1="202" x2="180" y2="226" marker-end="url(#d-wva-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="42" y="228" width="276" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="180" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">3 Complete payment</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="180" y1="284" x2="180" y2="308" marker-end="url(#d-wva-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="42" y="310" width="276" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="180" y="344" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">4 Confirm booking</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="370" y="10" width="340" height="400" rx="14"></rect>
		<text x="386" y="40" font-weight="700">Autonomous: path chosen at run time</text>
		<text x="540" y="394" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">stops on a stop condition</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="390" y="187" width="100" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="440" y="221" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Agent</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="546" y="64" width="150" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="621" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">verify identity</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="546" y="187" width="150" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="621" y="221" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">search</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="546" y="310" width="150" height="56" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="621" y="344" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">ask user</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="492" y1="215" x2="544" y2="215" marker-start="url(#d-wva-arrow)" marker-end="url(#d-wva-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="476" y1="185" x2="560" y2="122" marker-start="url(#d-wva-arrow)" marker-end="url(#d-wva-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="524" y="140" text-anchor="end" class="dg-edge-label">login required</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="476" y1="245" x2="560" y2="308" marker-start="url(#d-wva-arrow)" marker-end="url(#d-wva-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="522" y="300" text-anchor="end" class="dg-edge-label">layover OK?</text>
	</g>
</svg>
